 core by factoring out internal retry logic and applying several performance-focused hot path optimizations.\nOptimizes object property merging and array merges when building request options.\n\n### Build System\n\n* update dependencies (7e30da61b41c5edf7d51d410518865cdb797882f)\nUpdates various dependencies and unifies node engine to >=20.0.0 across all packages.\n\n* update pnpm-workspace allowBuilds (cfabc24e652af782549fe7cf671ef46bef464388)\nSimplifies the pnpm-workspace config by only keeping esbuild in the `allowBuilds` list.","tree":{"sha":"0c01f63df6c3326b486e49f95236d3f115123adc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/git/trees/0c01f63df6c3326b486e49f95236d3f115123adc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/git/commits/a2a5a4bf00870cc75410755f28b9dc4571be1be5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32174276?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/semantic-release-bot","id":32174276,"login":"semantic-release-bot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTc0Mjc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot","use