816b0bf9fe218225d47a5092c4d6"}],"sha":"bc6b70db9199f985ce908688fc4e0ac16e05ec6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/commits/bc6b70db9199f985ce908688fc4e0ac16e05ec6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32174276?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/semantic-release-bot","id":32174276,"login":"semantic-release-bot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTc0Mjc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/commits/74c279893fec816b0bf9fe218225d47a5092c4d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T16:53:57Z","email":"semantic-release-bot@martynus.net","name":"semantic-release-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T16:53:57Z","email":"semantic-release-bot@martynus.net","name":"semantic-release-bot"},"message":"chore(release): 3.3.0 [skip ci]\n\n## [3.3.0](https://github.com/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/compare/v3.2.2...v3.3.0) (2026-04-09)\n\n### Features\n\n* add allowScripts option to getHtmlFragment (806476bea43b1a74c4df5e6b89d2509e3d5ebb90)\nIntroduces a new `allowScripts` option to `getHtmlFragment()` that controls whether DOMPurify strips `<script>` tags from HTML fragment responses. By default, scripts are stripped, ensuring safety for cross-origin content. When `allowScripts: true` is provided, DOMPurify preserves `<script>` elements and their attributes, suitable for trusted same-origin fragments.\n\nAs part of this enhancement, DOMPurify initialization is refactored. The lazy `domReady` promise now imports and caches the DOMPurify instance, eliminating the previous chain of separate getter functions. A new `handleHtmlFragmentWithScripts` handler is added to support this feature, and comprehensive tests are included to verify script-stripping behavior, script preservation, and the continued sanitization of inline event handlers.","tree":{"sha":"e416deacca9a7b9971a0f9cccea70f6bb1c9a5fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/git/trees/e416deacca9a7b9971a0f9cccea70f6bb1c9a5fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/git/commits/74c279893fec816b0bf9fe218225d47a5092c4d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32174276?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/semantic-release-bot","id":32174276,"login":"semantic-release-bot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTc0Mjc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release