author":{"date":"2026-04-09T16:51:09Z","email":"jason.dimeo@gmail.com","name":"jason.dimeo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T16:52:53Z","email":"jason.dimeo@gmail.com","name":"jason.dimeo"},"message":"feat: add allowScripts option to getHtmlFragment\n\nIntroduces a new `allowScripts` option to `getHtmlFragment()` that controls whether DOMPurify strips `<script>` tags from HTML fragment responses. By default, scripts are stripped, ensuring safety for cross-origin content. When `allowScripts: true` is provided, DOMPurify preserves `<script>` elements and their attributes, suitable for trusted same-origin fragments.\n\nAs part of this enhancement, DOMPurify initialization is refactored. The lazy `domReady` promise now imports and caches the DOMPurify instance, eliminating the previous chain of separate getter functions. A new `handleHtmlFragmentWithScripts` handler is added to support this feature, and comprehensive tests are included to verify script-stripping behavior, script preservation, and the continued sanitization of inline event handlers.","tree":{"sha":"e8acdee74b457e7b7a5bd3dac2459fccb95accf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/git/trees/e8acdee74b457e7b7a5bd3dac2459fccb95accf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/git/commits/806476bea43b1a74c4df5e6b89d2509e3d5ebb90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1047437?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D1g1talEntr0py/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D1g1talEntr0py/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D1g1talEntr0py/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D1g1talEntr0py/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/D1g1talEntr0py","id":1047437,"login":"D1g1talEntr0py","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDc0Mzc=","org