n\n### Miscellaneous Chores\n\n* add explicit type annotation to defaultOrigin (c938eb124fcb82e539af8f4e0ba02c16ddd39193)\nImproves type safety and predictability by declaring a clear string type for the origin constant.\n\n* **docs:** revise feature comparison (9daaa2457e71ce3b2e34210de871550bb0e824cf)\n\n### Build System\n\n* enable isolatedDeclarations in tsconfig (3a51dae3d455d01a522fa7464255b9e16ce6bf22)\nEnhances build performance and compatibility with transpilers by enforcing isolated declaration generation.","tree":{"sha":"5fbc967e4a8f17f2d29a6b676c8e6bd0ae2b4633","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/git/trees/5fbc967e4a8f17f2d29a6b676c8e6bd0ae2b4633"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/D1g1talEntr0py/transportr/git/commits/77ea37c55cdd5b30e3c3c65bf86b1fd979861295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32174276?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/semantic-release-bot","id":32174276,"login":"semantic-release-bot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTc0Mjc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot","user_view_type":"pu