:"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commits/b648bb0647feca0a401e2312854723c26054789d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T19:05:57Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T19:05:57Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"refactor(shell): drive NF manifest from menu API — no static federation.manifest.json\n\nThe menu service (backed by MenuEntry CRDs) is now the single source of truth\nfor both navigation and remote loading.\n\nChanges:\n- MenuItem gains remoteEntry: string — the URL to the remote''s remoteEntry.json,\n  set by the operator from the CRD spec when registering the menu item\n- shell/main.ts: fetch /api/menu before initFederation, build the NF manifest\n  dynamically (Object.fromEntries remote → remoteEntry), stash items on window\n  so the Angular initializer reuses them without a second fetch\n- shell/app.config.ts: read __MENU_ITEMS__ from window; fallback re-fetch only\n  for unit tests where main.ts doesn''t run\n- Delete federation.manifest.json — it served no purpose that the menu API\n  doesn''t already cover\n- mock-menu.json: add remoteEntry localhost URLs for dev\n- broker MenuItem: update comment, add remoteEntry field; rebuild dist\n\nIn production each MenuEntry CRD carries .spec.remoteEntry pointing at the\ngateway-routed URL (e.g. https://gateway/overview/remoteEntry.json).\nThe operator writes that into the menu service, which the shell reads on boot.\nNo shell redeployment needed when a new remote is added or removed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b34ecef997408e23f1b49ce030c8124187918194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/trees/b34ecef997408e23f1b49ce030c8124187918194"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/commits/b648bb0647feca0a401e2312854723c26054789d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commit/b648bb0647feca0a401e2312854723c26054789d","node_id":"C_kwDOII9hqdoAKGI2NDhiYjA2NDdmZWNhMGE0MDFlMjMxMjg1NDcyM2MyNjA1NDc4OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commit/f5dd745883200d32d2d9511f4cf9a6f49dd4473f","sha":"f5dd745883200d32d2d9511f4cf9a6f49dd4473f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commits/f5dd745883200d32d2d9511f4cf9a6f49dd4473f"}],"sha":"b648bb0647feca0a401e2312854723c26054789d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commits/b648bb0647feca0a401e2312854723c26054789d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commits/f5dd745883200d32d2d9511f4cf9a6f49dd4473f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T19:00:29Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T19:00:29Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"docs: comprehensive rewrite of README for example repo\n\nCovers everything in the current implementation:\n- Architecture diagram (7 remotes, shell composition flow)\n- All key technical decisions with code snippets:\n  - Native Federation vs Webpack MF\n  - Zoneless + standalone\n  - Signal-based shared state with BroadcastChannel loop fix\n  - Dynamic routes from REST API\n  - Command palette\n  - Dark mode token architecture and the :root var() chain problem\n- Updated getting started (prestart hook, workspace structure)\n- Kubernetes section rewritten around Gateway API (HTTPRoute):\n  - Why HTTPRoute > Ingress for MFE teams\n  - Per-chart HTTPRoute with URL rewrite example\n  - Helm chart structure with platform/feature team split\n  - MenuEntry CRD full spec + operator integration pattern\n  - End-to-end deployment loop showing helm install → operator →\n    shell re-poll → route live, all without touching any other service\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b89a5b2d297c4a984c74b45dd7d087552b918de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/trees/0b89a5b2d297c4a984c74b45dd7d087552b918de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/commits/f5dd745883200d32d2d9511f4cf9a6f49dd4473f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commit/f5dd745883200d32d2d9511f4cf9a6f49dd4473f","node_id":"C_kwDOII9hqdoAKGY1ZGQ3NDU4ODMyMDBkMzJkMmQ5NTExZjRjZjlhNmY0OWRkNDQ3M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commit/abc2b9c9093ed9ba15d178251ccadb04e443b261","sha":"abc2b9c9093ed9ba15d178251ccadb04e443b261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commits/abc2b9c9093ed9ba15d178251ccadb04e443b261"}],"sha":"f5dd745883200d32d2d9511f4cf9a6f49dd4473f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commits/f5dd745883200d32d2d9511f4cf9a6f49dd4473f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commits/abc2b9c9093ed9ba15d178251ccadb04e443b261/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T18:50:03Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T18:50:03Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"fix(broker): eliminate BroadcastChannel infinite loop for array state\n\nThe boolean ''broadcasting'' flag was set synchronously but Angular''s\neffect() is scheduled asynchronously — by the time the effect fires the\nflag was already false, so every cross-tab message triggered a re-broadcast.\n\nFor string signals Angular''s Object.is equality check happened to bound\nthe loop to one extra round-trip. For the ''users: string[]'' signal,\nBroadcastChannel always delivers a new object reference via structured\nclone, so Object.is is always false — causing an unbounded feedback loop\nhammering localStorage and the channel on every microtask.\n\nFix:\n- Replace boolean flag with a Set<keyof AppState> (inboundKeys) that\n  tracks which keys are currently being updated from a cross-tab message\n- Guard cleared with queueMicrotask() so effects have time to flush first\n- Skip .set() entirely when incoming value equals current value\n  (JSON comparison for arrays, strict equality for primitives)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa16141364186ed40a47131cc0d7ecba5ffd7b0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/trees/fa16141364186ed40a47131cc0d7ecba5ffd7b0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/commits/abc2b9c9093ed9ba15d178251ccadb04e443b261","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https