repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commits/81ed54501173766a2513a2cdfe89d6851a8070c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T18:21:03Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T18:21:03Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"feat(shell): add command palette with keyboard-first quick search\n\nReplaces the inline menu search with a full command palette (VS Code style):\n\n- Press ''S'' anywhere (outside inputs) to open\n- Type to filter all registered menu items instantly\n- ↑/↓ arrows to move selection, Enter to navigate, Escape to close\n- Click any result to navigate\n- Animated backdrop + slide-down panel\n- Footer shows keyboard hint legend\n\nImplementation:\n- CommandPaletteComponent lives in shell, uses MenuRegistryService signal\n- Global @HostListener on window:keydown handles all keyboard interaction\n- All state managed with Angular signals (visible, query, activeIndex, filtered)\n- Full light/dark mode support via PrimeNG CSS tokens\n- Sidebar now shows a ''Press S to search'' affordance instead of an input\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a89628dc3998f5dc062e2532c5e9a9f2af2fe6db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/trees/a89628dc3998f5dc062e2532c5e9a9f2af2fe6db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/commits/81ed54501173766a2513a2cdfe89d6851a8070c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com