thub.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/commits/9cf15fa5781c197a03bd999a555059b1f102b012/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T18:15:34Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T18:15:34Z","email":"casper.elkrog@dever.dk","name":"czprz"},"message":"feat(charts): theme-reactive dataset colors for all chart components\n\nAll 4 chart components now swap both dataset fill/border colors AND\nchart options (legend, grid, axis labels) together in a single effect()\nwhen the theme signal changes.\n\nColor palettes:\n- Light: standard mid-range hues (#42A5F5, #FF6384, etc.)\n- Dark:  lighter Material 200-level equivalents (#90CAF9, #FF8FAB, etc.)\n  that read clearly against the dark card background (#27272a)\n\nPowerProductionNow radar chart also updates point border colors\nto match the card background so halos blend in both modes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"76a9f22b6338072f6ac5981bcb1229141c216d8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/trees/76a9f22b6338072f6ac5981bcb1229141c216d8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dever-labs/angular-micro-frontend/git/commits/9cf15fa5781c197a03bd999a555059b1f102b012","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57328905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/czprz","id":57328905,"login":"czprz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzI4OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/czprz/received_ev