"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/af612857b9f5d5280711ab06e9e36a59c8624ad0","node_id":"C_kwDOIKc9NtoAKGFmNjEyODU3YjlmNWQ1MjgwNzExYWIwNmU5ZTM2YTU5Yzg2MjRhZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/d4254dad35d22905fa67276172c7fc367df2096f","sha":"d4254dad35d22905fa67276172c7fc367df2096f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/d4254dad35d22905fa67276172c7fc367df2096f"}],"sha":"af612857b9f5d5280711ab06e9e36a59c8624ad0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/af612857b9f5d5280711ab06e9e36a59c8624ad0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/StuartHarris","id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/d4254dad35d22905fa67276172c7fc367df2096f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:22:06Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:09:55Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"message":"docs(typegen): describe the generated BoltFFI bridge\n\nThe typegen chapter gains a \"Bridging to BoltFFI\" section for the boltffi(..)\ncodegen setting, the generated FfiBridge and the one-argument Core\nconstructors, with the Swift platforms floor and the wasm-before-typegen\nordering that follow from it. The iOS, Android and React shell chapters and the\nmigration guide stop showing a hand-written LiveBridge. The generated-core RFC\nrecords the bridged constructor as an opt-in, the alternatives it displaces and\nits build consequences, and the CHANGELOG gets the 0.21.0 entry.","tree":{"sha":"597c2f0d718f9b8cc1e28229d0a95640e45c10b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/trees/597c2f0d718f9b8cc1e28229d0a95640e45c10b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/commits/d4254dad35d22905fa67276172c7fc367df2096f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/StuartHarris","id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/d4254dad35d22905fa67276172c7fc367df2096f","node_id":"C_kwDOIKc9NtoAKGQ0MjU0ZGFkMzVkMjI5MDVmYTY3Mjc2MTcyYzdmYzM2N2RmMjA5NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/562f482c6b3ea8906f072da040f262ebbdd992fa","sha":"562f482c6b3ea8906f072da040f262ebbdd992fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/562f482c6b3ea8906f072da040f262ebbdd992fa"}],"sha":"d4254dad35d22905fa67276172c7fc367df2096f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/d4254dad35d22905fa67276172c7fc367df2096f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/StuartHarris","id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/562f482c6b3ea8906f072da040f262ebbdd992fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:53:05Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:09:55Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"message":"feat(typegen): bridge the generated Core to BoltFFI''s CoreFfi\n\n`CodeGenerator::boltffi` names, per language, where `boltffi pack` put the\nbindings. Type generation then emits an `FfiBridge` over `CoreFfi` and a\none-argument `Core` constructor that builds one, so a shell writes nothing\nbut an effect handler. `CoreBridge` stays as the seam a fake or a\nmiddleware stack plugs into, and a language left unnamed is generated\nexactly as before.\n\nSwift additionally gains the package and target dependency on the bindings\nand the deployment-target floor they declare, the latter from a new\n`Config::platform`. `FfiBridge` joins the reserved type names.\n\nThe weather and notes shells drop their hand-written `LiveBridge`.\n\nNote: facet_generate is on a path dependency pending the upstream push.","tree":{"sha":"e4d93f56514d9ebf14cb7a4c1c8a5fe223e60866","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/trees/e4d93f56514d9ebf14cb7a4c1c8a5fe223e60866"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/commits/562f482c6b3ea8906f072da040f262ebbdd992fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/StuartHarris","id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/562f482c6b3ea8906f072da040f262ebbdd992fa","node_id":"C_kwDOIKc9NtoAKDU2MmY0ODJjNmIzZWE4OTA2ZjA3MmRhMDQwZjI2MmViYmRkOTkyZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/e5930069a8e8de1f5829095c72e4ea0b6c085af8","sha":"e5930069a8e8de1f5829095c72e4ea0b6c085af8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/e5930069a8e8de1f5829095c72e4ea0b6c085af8"}],"sha":"562f482c6b3ea8906f072da040f262ebbdd992fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/562f482c6b3ea8906f072da040f262ebbdd992fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/StuartHarris","id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/e5930069a8e8de1f5829095c72e4ea0b6c085af8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T10:39:30Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:09:54Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"message":"feat(typegen): make the generated Swift Core observable\n\nThe Swift `Core` is now `@Observable`, so a SwiftUI view that reads\n`core.view` is invalidated when the core renders and no shell-side box is\nneeded. `Core` alone is raised to macOS 14 / iOS 17 — everything else in\nthe generated module keeps the old availability — and the `onView`\ninitializer parameter is gone.\n\nC# `Core` implements `INotifyPropertyChanged` and raises `PropertyChanged`\nwhen `View` is replaced, so its `onView` parameter is gone too. Kotlin\nalready published a `StateFlow`, and TypeScript is unchanged.\n\nThe weather Apple shell drops `ViewStore` and injects the `Core` itself;\npreviews build one over a fake bridge and handler.","tree":{"sha":"1725a26ad6d3be8266c1aeaef850de3dc57af7ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/trees/1725a26ad6d3be8266c1aeaef850de3dc57af7ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/commits/e5930069a8e8de1f5829095c72e4ea0b6c085af8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/StuartHarris","id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stuar