"id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/65d1f7d052b1bf989e8fc979197c6da4980d3c28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T16:16:07Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:50:37Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"message":"fix(kv,time): keep the KeyValue and Time names, and make Clear a request\n\nReview feedback on #585 and #588.\n\nThe per-operation capabilities keep the names of the enum APIs they replace\nand move into a module each: crux_kv::store::KeyValue and\ncrux_time::clock::Time. The root types of the same name stay as they are for\nnow. The next breaking release removes them and re-exports the module types\nin their place, so code written against the module paths does not change.\n\noperation::Clear is a request answered with its TimerId, as TimeRequest::Clear\nwas answered with TimeResponse::Cleared, and clock::Time waits for that answer\nbefore resolving TimerOutcome::Cleared. The acknowledgement is a guarantee\nworth keeping: nothing on the shell fires for that timer after the app sees\nCleared. A shell that answers the original NotifyAt or NotifyAfter after the\ncore has cleared it does no harm, because the core ignores a late answer. The\nnew test answering_a_cleared_timer_late_is_ignored pins that down, since the\nmigration guide had claimed the opposite.","tree":{"sha":"dff250f4b65e8dc69ab7dae53cf43bf8d4b20008","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/trees/dff250f4b65e8dc69ab7dae53cf43bf8d4b20008"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/commits/65d1f7d052b1bf989e8fc979197c6da4980d3c28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/StuartHarris","id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/65d1f7d052b1bf989e8fc979197c6da4980d3c28","node_id":"C_kwDOIKc9NtoAKDY1ZDFmN2QwNTJiMWJmOTg5ZThmYzk3OTE5N2M2ZGE0OTgwZDNjMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/c75f846ce66c6d9e99e59959da8c120816a310c9","sha":"c75f846ce66c6d9e99e59959da8c120816a310c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/c75f846ce66c6d9e99e59959da8c120816a310c9"}],"sha":"65d1f7d052b1bf989e8fc979197c6da4980d3c28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/65d1f7d052b1bf989e8fc979197c6da4980d3c28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/StuartHarris","id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/c75f846ce66c6d9e99e59959da8c120816a310c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:03:29Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:50:37Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"message":"feat(kv,time,http): per-operation types alongside the enum APIs\n\ncrux_kv gains `operation::{Get,Set,Delete,Exists,ListKeys}` and a\n`KeyValueStore` capability that sends them; crux_time gains\n`operation::{Now,NotifyAt,NotifyAfter,Clear}` and a `Clock`. Each\noperation has exactly one output type and a statically declared request\nkind, so neither capability has to check that the shell answered the\nquestion it was asked. `Clear` is a notification, so clearing a timer\nresolves with `TimerOutcome::Cleared` without waiting for an ack.\n\n`HttpRequest` declares `RequestKind::Request`. The enum APIs are\nunchanged and nothing is deprecated yet.","tree":{"sha":"11942019656618d9446bce75ef218037cd0a8ba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/trees/11942019656618d9446bce75ef218037cd0a8ba7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/commits/c75f846ce66c6d9e99e59959da8c120816a310c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/StuartHarris","id":203552,"login":"StuartHarris","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU1Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/c75f846ce66c6d9e99e59959da8c120816a310c9","node_id":"C_kwDOIKc9NtoAKGM3NWY4NDZjZTY2YzZkOWU5OWU1OTk1OWRhOGMxMjA4MTZhMzEwYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/redbadger/crux/commit/8d0633779440881ae83a2e85e82eecb5ec5698a0","sha":"8d0633779440881ae83a2e85e82eecb5ec5698a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/8d0633779440881ae83a2e85e82eecb5ec5698a0"}],"sha":"c75f846ce66c6d9e99e59959da8c120816a310c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/c75f846ce66c6d9e99e59959da8c120816a310c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gi