arris/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/b90f46d75bb7737dbdd0324c80aa4d92f84c8454/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T15:24:41Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T13:03:41Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"message":"chore(deps): update pnpm dependencies\n\nRun `just update-pnpm-deps` across all eight pnpm shells. Notable moves:\nreact 19.2.7 -> 19.2.8, react-router 7.17 -> 7.18.2, vite 8.0.16 -> 8.2.1,\ntailwindcss 4.3.0 -> 4.3.3, postcss 8.5.15 -> 8.5.26, @tauri-apps/cli\n2.11.2 -> 2.11.4.\n\nThis also regenerates examples/weather/web-nextjs/pnpm-lock.yaml, which\npnpm was rejecting as broken (\"Cannot read properties of null (reading\n''specifier'')\") and silently ignoring on every install.\n\nThe @boltffi/runtime pin stays at 0.29.3, in lockstep with the crates.","tree":{"sha":"3e8bf447e1b9fb099251ab8426e834b95a29608f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/trees/3e8bf447e1b9fb099251ab8426e834b95a29608f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/commits/b90f46d75bb7737dbdd0324c80aa4d92f84c8454","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stuar