s/StuartHarris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/commits/2fe3a65aa9edd914be94d09e5b5e66793ff35e51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T15:13:47Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T13:03:41Z","email":"stuart.harris@red-badger.com","name":"Stuart Harris"},"message":"chore(deps): update Rust dependencies\n\nUpgrade unpinned version constraints across the workspace and all six\nexample workspaces, and refresh every lockfile. Notable majors: syn\n2 -> 3, darling 0.23 -> 0.24 and prettyplease 0.2 -> 0.3 in crux_macros,\nhttp 1.4 -> 1.5 in crux_http. No source changes were needed.\n\nDrop the unused `uniffi` entry from [workspace.dependencies] — nothing\ndepends on it; only uniffi_bindgen is used, behind the deprecated\nuniffi_compat_bindgen feature — and narrow the renovate rule to match.\n\nThe boltffi, Binaryen and facet pins stay put: facet_generate 0.18 still\ndepends on facet =0.44, so facet cannot move ahead of it.","tree":{"sha":"a12e65d67a320b69533f78c11c00c0fad130bcf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/trees/a12e65d67a320b69533f78c11c00c0fad130bcf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redbadger/crux/git/commits/2fe3a65aa9edd914be94d09e5b5e66793ff35e51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StuartHarris/following{/other_user}"