88+MDI74@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dmitriy Myakotin"},"message":"infra: #513: update dependencies to fix security issues\n\nList of fixed vulnerabilities:\n\n@babel/core: Arbitrary File Read via sourceMappingURL Comment - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-4x5r-pxfx-6jf8\n\najv has ReDoS when using `$data` option - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-2g4f-4pwh-qvx6\n\nbrace-expansion Regular Expression Denial of Service vulnerability - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v6h2-p8h4-qcjw\n\nbrace-expansion: Zero-step sequence causes process hang and memory exhaustion - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-f886-m6hf-6m8v\n\nPostCSS has XSS via Unescaped </style> in its CSS Stringify Output - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-qx2v-qp2m-jg93\n\njs-yaml has prototype pollution in merge (<<) - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mh29-5h37-fv8m\n\nJS-YAML: Quadratic-complexity DoS in merge key handling via repeated aliases - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-h67p-54hq-rp68\n\nyaml is vulnerable to Stack Overflow via deeply nested YAML collections - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-48c2-rrv3-qjmp","tree":{"sha":"c4ec07fcfb8a7e52f501cae9aadf55750ea30ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TourmalineCore/inner-circle-ui/git/trees/c4ec07fcfb8a7e52f501cae9aadf55750ea30ae2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TourmalineCore/inner-circle-ui/git/commits/16d62abad92bee1d4561edec7fb0628a65e2bd72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75628188?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MDI74","id":75628188,"login":"MDI74","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI4MTg4","organization