 Go module fixes (stdlib, caddy, quic-go, otel, x/crypto).\n\nRun npm audit fix to resolve 23 non-breaking npm vulnerabilities.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d31921648255b053c5510c8470a7f8bf0602115","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/trees/5d31921648255b053c5510c8470a7f8bf0602115"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/commits/52a5b937fb9e7162ba3bba56a947a32eb47897db","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d31921648255b053c5510c8470a7f8bf0602115\nparent 2a6ef2daf5028d4785bef6f6a4215ae9469e9922\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1780074088 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780074088 +0200\n\nfix(deps): update build-tools submodule and fix npm vulnerabilities (#330)\n\nRHCLOUD-48031\n\nUpdate build-tools submodule to latest (a96ba3d) which bumps the\nNode.js builder image from 9.7-1778648048 to 9.8-1779858762,\nfixing RPM vulnerabilities (libarchive, libnghttp2, glibc, etc.).\n\nThe caddy-ubi:latest runtime image is pulled fresh at build time,\npicking up Go module fixes (stdlib, caddy, quic-go, otel, x/crypto).\n\nRun npm audit fix to resolve 23 non-breaking npm vulnerabilities.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGcZoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjtEQAHRmIddo2CilzQcTvbMmnEbJ\nO9PoZupaB+JXS9ZJJtAsFlz2ptYEDXxCTe36cIZb1H8kHbmyc8SlGZ2YmTukW3Ts\ncblFUTMT+BDchGuLW4wULWCQnZk5xKEbXUV8hU2Aay7Ol9fSLhO7Io/uzK5EE0HH\nQW/SGdgaNoNa5bzMSOytw2PENajt63HfpSHV7Nu/QfOjJNvWOe44uupkwVU6Qgfb\n724yyItphIFnUZnIqXB5V/cUBsCVQqE/tHFTe04GwwCzCMRgNqcz1mPZ/9S0nC33\nySoWIHVJN3cqGYPhGn/W2IIaroICA7Oh5alANnmPxytrBCt1VJs9Hk78q6gOdNRN\nlYL8Ssdmhc1HJEQM1CXWY1htfgOh0O516jZT++DnnJez0EUTJvOtD/cLITGDykDV\nBnz81Cph9pxEqCkTy9192ys+XxMhBVjK4AxR899raEb2HZfFmlsbyAa0KlqcMgH8\nL+VGRUW2A+L1wSjzbXs8uVPBXVJ+prr/wexKHK5ub12JyTdlDmTahsLymIs9F3gc\neirl9JE8Vt66cno8sPtUBzlLsXk+l/+cfWKLgSRb