":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T19:26:13Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T19:26:13Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"message":"fix(feedback): target ::before pseudo-element for card hover border\n\nRHCLOUD-47953\nPF v6 clickable cards render borders via ::before pseudo-element,\nnot on the card element itself. The previous border-color on .feedback-card\nhad no effect because .pf-m-clickable sets ::before border to none.\nOverride with sufficient specificity to restore hover + focus-visible borders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"086b184ad7ebfc49e4c6fda39504b9ec992b18e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/trees/086b184ad7ebfc49e4c6fda39504b9ec992b18e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/commits/d676edc92ee29ac98ce5daed8bcdb57cbe50aa85","verification":{"payload":"tree 086b184ad7ebfc49e4c6fda39504b9ec992b18e5\nparent 4e686fbe16c797c79292c81267c17fe88cf52171\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1779909973 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1779909973 +0000\n\nfix(feedback): target ::before pseudo-element for card hover border\n\nRHCLOUD-47953\nPF v6 clickable cards render borders via ::before pseudo-element,\nnot on the card element itself. The previous border-color on .feedback-card\nhad no effect because .pf-m-clickable sets ::before border to none.\nOverride with sufficient specificity to restore hover + focus-visible borders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSoG2zhRLubAWkKO1EKIuJ/MUEv7gUCahdFVQAKCRAKIuJ/MUEv\n7ir1AQD1T+hIrEtEehQfjGjYUVE+/xx+9Dk2Z9wufcTj7UPRjAD/bG0H4VHBmR30\nF8rmnNjpqDzrWFo8x9IMYzVpz8xZ1ws=\n=GRwz\n-----END PGP SIGN