api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/commits/f8c0a79605aeefd723b891e2ecc74807724fb121/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T20:20:30Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T22:14:03Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"message":"fix(help-panel): re-assert drawer content after navigation to keep panel open\n\nRHCLOUD-47951\nAfter client-side navigate(), call chrome.drawerActions.setDrawerPanelContent()\nto ensure the drawer content atom stays defined. This prevents Chrome''s\nsafety-net useEffect from closing the drawer when atoms briefly clear\nduring route transitions.\n\nAlso wraps LearnPanel stories with MemoryRouter to fix test-storybook CI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"61c9391645a857143688137253f6393d4c8ad4a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/trees/61c9391645a857143688137253f6393d4c8ad4a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/commits/f8c0a79605aeefd723b891e2ecc74807724fb121","verification":{"payload":"tree 61c9391645a857143688137253f6393d4c8ad4a0\nparent 3b6b8ac67bf268494de276fb8f09b5284343469b\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1779826830 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1779833643 +0000\n\nfix(help-panel): re-assert drawer content after navigation to keep panel open\n\nRHCLOUD-47951\nAfter client-side navigate(), call chrome.drawerActions.setDrawerPanelContent()\nto ensure the drawer content atom stays defined. This prevents Chrome''s\nsafety-net useEffect from closing the drawer when atoms briefly clear\nduring route transitions.\n\nAl