igation, cross-origin falls back to\nwindow.location.assign.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8ca0434e697221a1c0d9f6758b916589f401d74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/trees/e8ca0434e697221a1c0d9f6758b916589f401d74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/commits/3b6b8ac67bf268494de276fb8f09b5284343469b","verification":{"payload":"tree e8ca0434e697221a1c0d9f6758b916589f401d74\nparent c5ab68245d4d52dcfe39307f0b6d89e88a484f78\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1779825755 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1779833643 +0000\n\nfix(help-panel): add Router context for useNavigate and handle cross-origin URLs\n\nRHCLOUD-47951\nWrap Cypress and Storybook test components with MemoryRouter since\nAPIPanel, LearnPanel and SearchResultItem now use useNavigate().\nUse react-router Link for the API catalog link so it renders as <a>.\nAdd origin check in handleResourceClick per CodeRabbit review:\nsame-origin uses client-side navigation, cross-origin falls back to\nwindow.location.assign.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSoG2zhRLubAWkKO1EKIuJ/MUEv7gUCahYbKwAKCRAKIuJ/MUEv\n7l/OAP9krS1/dKhiW5filEBxXoO/Vc5hVb92Bg3wkSENdkDURwD5AeHQFCCYOJYG\n+gqLxg0GBnEX50xKLZlMhRDaRM/ofAA=\n=WCUP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-26T22:14:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://git