-brandon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catastrophe-brandon","id":20647751,"login":"catastrophe-brandon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjQ3NzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catastrophe-brandon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/commits/7b4f04db5aff84a3ebf6809a2a76f6f9ba7c362c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T16:36:53Z","email":"btweed@redhat.com","name":"Darth Tweed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T16:36:53Z","email":"btweed@redhat.com","name":"Darth Tweed"},"message":"test: migrate IQE feedback and support case tests to Playwright\n\nMigrates feedback and support case e2e tests from IQE to Playwright\nwith comprehensive test utilities and helper functions.\n\nNew test suites:\n- feedback.spec.ts: Tests feedback form submission flow including\n  navigation, form interaction, and success message validation\n- support-case.spec.ts: Tests support case creation flows, including\n  navigation to Customer Portal and handling of various support case\n  entry points across different help panel states\n- support-case-helpers.ts: Page object helpers for support case tests\n  (openSupportPanel, isEmptyState, getSupportPanelLocators)\n\nTest utilities refactoring:\n- Extracted duplicated help panel interaction patterns into reusable\n  helper functions to reduce code duplication (~25% reduction)\n- openHelpPanel(): Opens help panel and waits for it to load\n- switchToHelpPanelTab(): Switches to a specific tab by name\n- waitForHelpPanelTabsLoaded(): Waits for tabs container to render\n- waitForSupportTabLoaded(): Waits for support content (empty or table)\n- navigateToFeedbackTab(): Navigates to feedback tab and waits\n\nTimeout constants centralized:\n- PAGE_LOAD_TIMEOUT (60s) - Initial page load\n- ELEMENT_VISIBLE_TIMEOUT (10s) - Element visibility\n- RESOURCE_COUNT_TIMEOUT (20s) - Resource count extraction\n- CHROME_HEADER_LOAD_TIMEOUT (30s) - Chrome shell header (for flaky first test)\n- SUPPORT_API_LOAD_TIMEOUT (15s) - Support API data\n- HELP_PANEL_TABS_LOAD_TIMEOUT (10s) - Tab rendering\n- FEEDBACK_SUBMISSION_TIMEOUT (10s) - Feedback submission\n\nTest improvements:\n- Replaced runtime conditional skip with test.fixme() for deterministic\n  test execution (support cases table test requires test user to have\n  open support cases in stage environment)\n\nAll tests handle feature flag dependencies and environment-specific\nbehavior appropriately. Incorporates changes from PR #304 to consolidate\ntest migration efforts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e516cf89ea3586d545e7b951fbeca2f13de502a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/trees/0e516cf89ea3586d545e7b951fbeca2f13de502a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/learning-resources/git/commits/7b4f04db5aff84a3ebf6809a2a76f6f9ba7c362c","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e516cf89ea3586d545e7b951fbeca2f13de502a\nparent 47bddc1de08b23b8ebc36e45a9a7e061c0f55531\nauthor Darth Tweed <btweed@redhat.com> 1779295013 -0500\ncommitter Darth Tweed <btweed@redhat.com> 1779295013 -0500\n\ntest: migrate IQE feedback and support case tests to Playwright\n\nMigrates feedback and support case e2e tests from IQE to Playwright\nwith comprehensive test utilities and helper functions.\n\nNew test suites:\n- feedback.spec.ts: Tests feedback form submission flow including\n  navigation, form interaction, and success message validation\n- support-case.spec.ts: Tests support case creation flows, including\n  navigation to Customer Portal and handling of various support case\n  entry points across different help panel states\n- support-case-helpers.ts: Page object helpers for support case tests\n  (openSupportPanel, isEmptyState, getSupportPanelLocators)\n\nTest utilities refactoring:\n- Extracted duplicated help panel interaction patterns into reusable\n  helper functions to reduce code duplication (~25% reduction)\n- openHelpPanel(): Opens help panel and waits for it to load\n- switchToHelpPanelTab(): Switches to a specific tab by name\n- waitForHelpPanelTabsLoaded(): Waits for tabs container to render\n- waitForSupportTabLoaded(): Waits for support content (empty or table)\n- navigateToFeedbackTab(): Navigates to feedback tab and waits\n\nTimeout constants centralized:\n- PAGE_LOAD_TIMEOUT (60s) - Initial page load\n- ELEMENT_VISIBLE_TIMEOUT (10s) - Element visibility\n- RESOURCE_COUNT_TIMEOUT (20s) - Resource count extraction\n- CHROME_HEADER_LOAD_TIMEOUT (30s) - Chrome shell header (for flaky first test)\n- SUPPORT_API_LOAD_TIMEOUT (15s) - Support API data\n- HELP_PANEL_TABS_LOAD_TIMEOUT (10s) - Tab rendering\n- FEEDBACK_SUBMISSION_TIMEOUT (10s) - Feedback submission\n\nTest improvements:\n- Replaced runtime conditional skip with test.fixme() for deterministic\n  test execution (support cases table test requires test user to have\n  open support cases in stage environment)\n\nAll tests handle feature flag dependencies and environment-specific\nbehavior appropriately. Incorporates changes from PR #304 to consolidate\ntest migration efforts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEg1gFhV2SAAxV1xcn7EKpxV2kGsEFAmoN4yUbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEu