l_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-atlas/commits/36c5f7f01787938220fca8c2014690796bcaf9b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T19:30:11Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T19:30:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"build: Update macOS runner to use latest version (#74)\n\n* build: Update macOS runner to use latest version\n\nThe latest numeric os runner is 26 so this is pretty out of date.  Just pin to the latest since we''re just checking to make sure the cli will work on macs.\n\n* test: raise macOS disk usage limit for newer runner\n\nThe macos-latest runner (macOS 15) uses slightly more disk space for\ngit sparse-checkout operations than macos-13 — observed ~8848 KB vs.\nthe previous 8500 KB limit. Raise the threshold to 9500 KB to\naccommodate the newer runner while still catching pathological cases\n(e.g. cloning the full edx-platform repo at ~1 GB).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e760cc0784ba9a48cafd0c68e0346b4eb662ef3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-atlas/git/trees/7e760cc0784ba9a48cafd0c68e0346b4eb662ef3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/openedx-atlas/git/commits/36c5f7f01787938220fca8c2014690796bcaf9b6","verification":{"payload":"tree 7e760cc0784ba9a48cafd0c68e0346b4eb662ef3\nparent cba6a9cd1633e44cc398a2d091e7e04c150545ce\nauthor Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1780083011 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780083011 -0600\n\nbuild: Update macOS runner to use latest version (#74)\n\n* build: Update macOS runner to use latest version\n\nThe latest numeric os runner is 26 so this is pretty out of date.  Just pin to the latest since we''re just checking to make sure the cli will work on macs.\n\n* test: raise macOS disk usage limit for newer runner\n\nThe macos-latest runner (macOS 15) uses slightly more disk space for\ngit sparse-checkout operations than macos-13 — observed ~8848 KB vs.\nthe previous 8500 KB limit. Raise the threshold to 9500 KB to\naccommodate the newer runner while still catching pathological cases\n(e.g. cloning the full edx-platform repo at ~1 GB).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGelDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxssQAFUbMAvcF1kOZYK3gepP2IkK\nR8as3pYFdRs275thiP5hQvAXpqqMOjssDgenAynjmUOXAsG8YzlAWqdlJNE4L1J7\nnhi03jqcNif63gzeuka0lk9Bgr7ERbgNkmCX1rDoWE4x8YjJ3cTbbugvdopYtDk3\nLwZN/4ticVM1virPk8zOn5Iddlhgi7xm/QRWz+LaPrPSzT6J1boqIDDalhEscUKK\nCyi5dShYUIxsvBRMFtnH2kLJshFMciGJJBd8Q80iyaUhpZgMRHJonrl2pSwlujE/\n6QYvF/kVcs8eNYjqY7KWe+bi1hBQ4Agr5ajq7pmdFjdbws1bu0H259hDXyyBWV6f\nSUtMZXiJqcI1UnzEXdvylaoXk69jFoAeX6obiJHi+jqKWv90fDoXICoJu0xA4/+J\nd4+LUldKC1dcrjcd2yHCAcHCbTHCLJcKAtXWXUClHZM3ZbD72bJdi4Fu8ofq4IN0\nmFLqfMfAuGmjLc+lnZRQNCVmeNOiWrPHH3CDwn+/mMIbXAkya5VZKJVT+pOrlBzb\n0haC6U0rA5KqZSPQzJLFTtJm3dTlUuEsxL1jZxVtow8q+/1NP2xtwZDGCmPJr031\newoeO0DFE+YXeRNF50u8WruQFnoOTe7v2F760MUSHO42jAG5pF7Dl0vO0gNOlif8\n6QzcFjrhfqOBa5X+q5vZ\n=mtlq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T19:30:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github