anFreestone","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-serials-management/commits/7a07bca58e14efe03536c921ac8c893d4d710cfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T10:46:47Z","email":"54310740+EthanFreestone@users.noreply.github.com","name":"EthanFreestone"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T10:46:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ERM-3851: Long standing connection issues (#186)\n\n* fix(dependencies): Bump web-toolkit and grails okapi to latest versions\n\nShould fix fed lock and connections issues\n\nAlso include .idea files in gitignore\n\n* build(config): Set up configuration to use db.* application config values\n\n* build(ci): Bump postgres version in docker compose to PG17\n\n* build(dependencies): Bump security versions\n\n* fix(dependencies): Revert to org.grails.plugins:spring-security-core:6.1.1 for this PR\n\n* fix: Dataload shouldn''t be tied to successful cleanup\n\n* fix: Actually use resolved tenant schema\n\n* fix: Moved cleanupEnumerationLevelMetadata to tenant_enabled subscription\n\n* fix: onTenantEnabled parameters\n\n* refactor: Move cleanup enumeration to tenant_enabled event\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jack Golding <jack.golding@k-int.com>","tree":{"sha":"e307629880be2eef03088be37d0b4ac701586614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-serials-management/git/trees/e307629880be2eef03088be37d0b4ac701586614"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-serials-management/git/commits/7a07bca58e14efe03536c921ac8c893d4d710cfc","verification":{"payload":"tree e307629880be2eef03088be37d0b4ac701586614\nparent e394c567939b763eea3827dcdb68b3f94330f4c0\nauthor EthanFreestone <54310740+EthanFreestone@users.noreply.github.com> 1764240407 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1764240407 +0000\n\nERM-3851: Long standing connection issues (#186)\n\n* fix(dependencies): Bump web-toolkit and grails okapi to latest versions\n\nShould fix fed lock and connections issues\n\nAlso include .idea files in gitignore\n\n* build(config): Set up configuration to use db.* application config values\n\n* build(ci): Bump postgres version in docker compose to PG17\n\n* build(dependencies): Bump security versions\n\n* fix(dependencies): Revert to org.grails.plugins:spring-security-core:6.1.1 for this PR\n\n* fix: Dataload shouldn''t be tied to successful cleanup\n\n* fix: Actually use resolved tenant schema\n\n* fix: Moved cleanupEnumerationLevelMetadata to tenant_enabled subscription\n\n* fix: onTenantEnabled parameters\n\n* refactor: Move cleanup enumeration to tenant_enabled event\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jack Golding <jack.golding@k-int.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpKCwXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAf8sQAIcr9mp5Oxi6U4PV/vXLyZlL\nr9Lkp6Zjqk3VECXFvmtHQxlTNtNsTajGWxGTl2L1V/8oxB4joOG/toZyB4oCOWZP\ndiFfv1Bp2iN6n+emqIetH0fAgpE2mz6132+zYgjsI/P0bJJFTniTbeiN2icFPkUd\nxVuA+eiFXQhkL5vDr5yREZzezYMGmKWV6MYHFjkpB2Y54Yc0Fz3GBYWQxcvZlAeA\ne4kGPWAd4OneJmN8Hv084sglV/F5c/AvXYPG0KAx+fBGRLJCPkuUxkKjM4mR+GpS\nh8zArHie/3uPCoH8Q20rZe96rITuKqC7mzGjWlnxhLS1mxFSrYnBEzZmyQAjhzhU\njYjJAIy9t2sahG+3ts/k80cPzu9pwOh0OpmQEqKHp0l/P7aX64ZtYTy5WUmd39mH\nhjtnkjnOZCc0/EeZpzwCziaK614d5vBe/jeKcYsKKm1DPaYn8Yx0hI0L3VCj9576\nYo9ed8n3Cpe3KEoFiUu1T2dXytjY1u7xMNZ/t82FnmYFrj70909EsWY7PjW3ojbY\nn29AzCxGJavqQTqOaagCys43RJsiS4w+1YaFpwXU3ABL16hsWrMzeM0ROAsCMwZs\nl4jqcFCFH3uQPWLvDT3s6J8itDxK16lQNSmGj2AwOjnCjialaNzZcUSU0AUip/tq\n7xzPPu0YZh6rMlncidLc\n=wQSd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-27T10:46:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","htm