":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-serials-management/commits/e394c567939b763eea3827dcdb68b3f94330f4c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42971992?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CalamityC","id":42971992,"login":"CalamityC","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTcxOTky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CalamityC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-serials-management/commits/9514b9cd9b15e53f1eada2cee15e61a8fa0e687d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T10:25:30Z","email":"42971992+CalamityC@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Claudia Malzer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T10:25:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MODSER-130 Ensure \"missingRefData\" categories are only created where needed (#185)\n\n* * change missing refdata values migration file\n\n* * fix RefdataSpec.groovy\n\n* chore: Refactor the Category insertion segments\n\nUsed the following regex:\n\nsql.execute\\(\"\"\"\\n\\s+INSERT INTO \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_category \\(rdc_id, rdc_version, rdc_description, internal\\)\\n\\s+SELECT md5\\(random\\(\\)\\:\\:text \\|\\| clock_timestamp\\(\\)\\:\\:text\\), 0, (.*), false\\n\\s+WHERE NOT EXISTS \\(SELECT 1 FROM \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_category WHERE rdc_description = \\1\\);\\n\\s+\"\"\".toString\\(\\)\n\nThen replaced with\n\n// Create category $1 if not exists\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tsql.execute(\"\"\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tINSERT INTO \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_category (rdc_id, rdc_version, rdc_description, internal)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSELECT md5(random()::text || clock_timestamp()::text) as id,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t0 as version,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t$1 as description,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tfalse as internal\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tWHERE\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t-- don''t recreate category if it already exists\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tNOT EXISTS (\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSELECT 1 FROM \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_category WHERE\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\trdc_description = $1\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t);\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\"\"\".toString()\n\n* chore: Refactor UPDATE clauses\n\nI used regex\n\nsql.execute\\(\"\"\"\n          UPDATE \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.(.*)\n          SET\n            (.*) = \\(\n              SELECT rdv.rdv_id FROM \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_value rdv\n              JOIN \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_category rdc ON rdv.rdv_owner = rdc.rdc_id\n              WHERE rdc.rdc_description = (.*) AND rdv.rdv_value = (.*) LIMIT 1\n            \\)\n          WHERE NOT EXISTS \\(\n            SELECT 1 FROM \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_value\n            WHERE rdv_id = \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.\\1.\\2\n          \\);\n        \"\"\".toString\\(\\)\\)\n\nAnd replace:\n\nsql.execute(\"\"\"\n          UPDATE \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.$1 table\n          SET $2 = (\n            SELECT rv.rdv_id\n            FROM \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_value rv\n            JOIN \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_category rc\n            ON rv.rdv_owner = rc.rdc_id\n            WHERE rc.rdc_description = $3\n            AND rv.rdv_value = $4\n            LIMIT 1\n          )\n          WHERE\n            -- only touch rows whose current FK doesn''t exist in refdata_value\n            NOT EXISTS (\n            SELECT 1\n            FROM \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_value rvx\n            WHERE rvx.rdv_id = p.$2\n            );\n        \"\"\".toString())\n\n* fix: Whoops, forgot to replace p with table\n\n* chore: Replace `table` with refdata_replace_table\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ethan Freestone <ethan.freestone@k-int.co.uk>","tree":{"sha":"c0d00bd32c8d0be0e5ec9aef128860759b380ea0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-serials-management/git/trees/c0d00bd32c8d0be0e5ec9aef128860759b380ea0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/mod-serials-management/git/commits/9514b9cd9b15e53f1eada2cee15e61a8fa0e687d","verification":{"payload":"tree c0d00bd32c8d0be0e5ec9aef128860759b380ea0\nparent 13965f463bcf5973a47f518a1dc3dd359c1470ba\nauthor Claudia Malzer <42971992+CalamityC@users.noreply.github.com> 1763029530 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763029530 +0000\n\nMODSER-130 Ensure \"missingRefData\" categories are only created where needed (#185)\n\n* * change missing refdata values migration file\n\n* * fix RefdataSpec.groovy\n\n* chore: Refactor the Category insertion segments\n\nUsed the following regex:\n\nsql.execute\\(\"\"\"\\n\\s+INSERT INTO \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_category \\(rdc_id, rdc_version, rdc_description, internal\\)\\n\\s+SELECT md5\\(random\\(\\)\\:\\:text \\|\\| clock_timestamp\\(\\)\\:\\:text\\), 0, (.*), false\\n\\s+WHERE NOT EXISTS \\(SELECT 1 FROM \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_category WHERE rdc_description = \\1\\);\\n\\s+\"\"\".toString\\(\\)\n\nThen replaced with\n\n// Create category $1 if not exists\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tsql.execute(\"\"\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tINSERT INTO \\$\\{database.defaultSchemaName\\}.refdata_category (rdc_id, rdc_version, rdc_description, internal)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSELECT md5(random()::text || clock_timestamp()::text) as id,\