0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T09:43:48Z","email":"me@dannyhw.com","name":"Daniel Williams"},"message":"chore: update to repack 5.3","tree":{"sha":"b6cb3a713e09d0989a38e75ca64dd87856d49190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/git/trees/b6cb3a713e09d0989a38e75ca64dd87856d49190"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/git/commits/05fb677394d57a85450935494f6fcb958166b4e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3481514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dannyhw","id":3481514,"login":"dannyhw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODE1MTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/callstack/super-app-showcase/commit/05fb677394d57a85450935494f6fcb958166b4e2","node_id":"C_kwDOIUdgAtoAKDA1ZmI2NzczOTRkNTdhODU0NTA5MzU0OTRmNmZjYjk1ODE2NmI0ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/callstack/super-app-showcase/commit/e1e8722f2caf922c73a9738ea1b82cae3c4de731","sha":"e1e8722f2caf922c73a9738ea1b82cae3c4de731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/commits/e1e8722f2caf922c73a9738ea1b82cae3c4de731"}],"sha":"05fb677394d57a85450935494f6fcb958166b4e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/commits/05fb677394d57a85450935494f6fcb958166b4e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3481514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dannyhw","id":3481514,"login":"dannyhw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODE1MTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyhw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/commits/e1e8722f2caf922c73a9738ea1b82cae3c4de731/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:41:39Z","email":"dannyhyunsoowilliams@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Williams"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:41:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Upgrade React Native toolchain (#174)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Upgrade the React Native ecosystem to React Native 0.86.2 and React\n19.2.8, including navigation, animation, native UI, Rspack, and Module\nFederation packages.\n- Pin the project to Node 24.18.0 and pnpm 11.18.0; migrate pnpm\nconfiguration to `pnpm-workspace.yaml`.\n- Centralize shared runtime and tooling versions in pnpm catalogs; app\nmanifests now use `catalog:` and the named `catalog:peer` range catalog.\n- Migrate all apps to ESLint 9 flat configuration, backed by React\nNative''s official flat config.\n- Add a root Prettier 3.9 setup with the official OXC parser plugin,\n`format`, and `format:check` scripts; format the existing baseline.\n- Migrate Material Design Icons from the legacy\n`react-native-vector-icons` package to\n`@react-native-vector-icons/material-design-icons`, use static imports,\nconfigure native fonts, and add the scoped `get-image` companion module\nfor Android tab icons.\n- Patch React Native Paper''s icon loader for the static scoped export\nand configure Re.Pack to resolve the companion peer package under pnpm.\n- Update the iOS Ruby tooling to CocoaPods 1.17.0 and xcodeproj 1.28.1.\n\n## Compatibility holds\n\n- Babel remains on the newest Babel 7 release: React Native 0.86 and\nRe.Pack''s current Babel loader are not Babel 8 compatible.\n- Jest remains on 29 and TypeScript on 6: the React Native testing\npreset has not completed a compatible Jest 30 upgrade.\n- React Native''s config includes an ESLint 8-only Flow plugin. This app\nhas no Flow source, so its Flow config is excluded while ESLint 9\nremains enabled for JavaScript and TypeScript.\n- `rnx-align-deps` cannot consume pnpm''s `catalog:` protocol. The\ncatalog is now validated through a frozen pnpm install and peer check;\nthe Rnx preset remains available for maintenance updates.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `pnpm format:check`\n- `pnpm check-deps` (frozen catalog resolution and peer check)\n- `pnpm lint` (two pre-existing inline-style warnings)\n- `pnpm typecheck`\n- `pnpm test` (one host test passes; React 19 reports an existing\n`act(...)` warning)\n- Re.Pack development bundles for iOS and Android\n- Android `:app:assembleDebug`, including the new icon font and\n`get-image` native modules\n\n## iOS follow-up\n\nPods resolve with the upgraded Ruby tooling, including the new icon\npods. Running `react-native run-ios` remains blocked by a CocoaPods/pnpm\nmonorepo `pathname contains null byte` failure; directly building the\nsource-core fallback then hits the existing JWTDecode module-map\nheader-layout issue. The iOS Simulator app is not yet launchable in this\nenvironment.","tree":{"sha":"fd404ffd3af3f26d30828e72feb7ddbfd317433d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/git/trees/fd404ffd3af3f26d30828e72feb7ddbfd317433d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/git/commits/e1e8722f2caf922c73a9738ea1b82cae3c4de731","verification":{"payload":"tree fd404ffd3af3f26d30828e72feb7ddbfd317433d\nparent 97e39e4524e0d19f23f1b029f313ab36726f9ea8\nauthor Daniel Williams <dannyhyunsoowilliams@gmail.com> 1785886899 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785886899 +0100\n\nUpgrade React Native toolchain (#174)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Upgrade the React Native ecosystem to React Native 0.86.2 and React\n19.2.8, including navigation, animation, native UI, Rspack, and Module\nFederation packages.\n- Pin the project to Node 24.18.0 and pnpm 11.18.0; migrate pnpm\nconfiguration to `pnpm-workspace.yaml`.\n- Centralize shared runtime and tooling versions in pnpm catalogs; app\nmanifests now use `catalog:` and the named `catalog:peer` range catalog.\n- Migrate all apps to ESLint 9 flat configuration, backed by React\nNative''s official flat config.\n- Add a root Prettier 3.9 setup with the official OXC parser plugin,\n`format`, and `format:check` scripts; format the existing baseline.\n- Migrate Material Design Icons from the legacy\n`react-native-vector-icons` package to\n`@react-native-vector-icons/material-design-icons`, use static imports,\nconfigure native fonts, and add the scoped `get-image` companion module\nfor Android tab icons.\n- Patch React Native Paper''s icon loader for the static scoped export\nand configure Re.Pack to resolve the companion peer package under pnpm.\n- Update the iOS Ruby tooling to CocoaPods 1.17.0 and xcodeproj 1.28.1.\n\n## Compatibility holds\n\n- Babel remains on the newest Babel 7 release: React Native 0.86 and\nRe.Pack''s current Babel loader are not Babel 8 compatible.\n- Jest remains on 29 and TypeScript on 6: the React Native testing\npreset has not completed a compatible Jest 30 upgrade.\n- React Native''s config includes an ESLint 8-only Flow plugin. This app\nhas no Flow source, so its Flow config is excluded while ESLint 9\nremains enabled for JavaScript and TypeScript.\n- `rnx-align-deps` cannot consume pnpm''s `catalog:` protocol. The\ncatalog is now validated through a frozen pnpm install and peer check;\nthe Rnx preset remains available for maintenance updates.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `pnpm format:check`\n- `pnpm check-deps` (frozen catalog resolution and peer check)\n- `pnpm lint` (two pre-existing inline-style warnings)\n- `pnpm typecheck`\n- `pnpm test` (one host test passes; React 19 reports an existing\n`act(...)` warning)\n- Re.Pack development bundles for iOS and Android\n- Android `:app:assembleDebug`, including the new icon font and\n`get-image` native modules\n\n## iOS follow-up\n\nPods resolve with the upgraded Ruby tooling, including the new icon\npods. Running `react-native run-ios` remains blocked by a CocoaPods/pnpm\nmonorepo `pathname contains null byte` failure; directly building the\nsource-core fallback then hits the existing JWTDecode module-map\nheader-layout issue. The iOS Simulator app is not yet launchable in this\nenvironment.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcnizCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMu0QADqpzvmCgygyWNFPac22S8e+\nEiVzJTTvUqG0uO6zFvN2lih6hBPf1o4BVdqk5lPkTWwoEhgpqzkfd7dnDQO3N4pJ\nCPNBq6Jh+AT6368GrUHd7uexHg8kFSDgelU1qr+oRsQvaGEn/RM0avREhqtoqZgS\nZ0f+2NeRlgyCmazIPQ20loapSJxX88JgpIGOsLueK/dxyuFmAqRMsmEqQa8AO0PP\nf3Ygtkt0Co8S2stxi3PYIR6JUXNlgSlsiA1dgu/WhQQe9j0y+GeSRii/jKkyfCWs\ni8Gamdx/lhP1Xd8EhLDUlzAeGCCBi5dz+mA9onncmZihGKU+vSEXaK/K51P6yDBR\nXUopGIw2z9rMFGmLM0vRf5U2xm2TguMLo3I4LTgFFZwpPue0gPC3lvtG0xTNwELn\nE2s6wjkdqH/Gfi3hnsT/nxCDEIle43reqopUHczoklzpFR+NNFbFXV0V9dqayuAg\nf4W4YD7Ol3lDOQ07MYYzmajlv7KUuuo3vGRDm2yzoQ2YUjbfnuoCrjbxkIPbf+Fy\ng/EfjvpuECz5RwhrJ/XyKFrZdKoL6OzZFq6Qk0bWEpBpIryTM2h7Upw