g_url":"https://api.github.com/users/burczu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/burczu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/burczu","id":7771498,"login":"burczu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NzE0OTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/burczu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/burczu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/burczu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/burczu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/burczu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/burczu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/commits/97e39e4524e0d19f23f1b029f313ab36726f9ea8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T06:24:03Z","email":"b.dybowski@gmail.com","name":"Bartek Dybowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T06:24:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fintech Super App refresh — React Native micro-frontends showcase (#170)\n\n## Summary\n\nA full rebuild of the Super App Showcase into a production-grade Fintech\ndemo app demonstrating React Native micro-frontend architecture with\nRe.Pack and Module Federation V2.\n\n- **Trading mini app** — live crypto asset list (Kraken WebSocket), Skia\nchart with OHLC history, trade bottom sheet and success screen,\nReanimated flash animations\n- **Wallet mini app** — real-time portfolio balance, per-asset holdings\nwith live value updates\n- **Auth mini app** — dark Fintech sign-in screen, AuthProvider gating\nthe tab bar\n- **SDK** — singleton KrakenWebSocketService shared across all mini\napps, PriceProvider, hooks, utilities\n- **Host shell** — dark theme, native bottom tabs, MF remote wiring,\nReact Compiler\n\n## Key patterns demonstrated\n\n- Leaf-component isolation (`PriceCell`, `ValueCell`) so only the price\nnode re-renders on ticks\n- `useTransition` / `startTransition` marking price updates as\nnon-priority\n- Shared singleton WebSocket — one connection across Trading and Wallet\nvia MF\n- Historical chart seeding from Kraken OHLC REST API\n- TypeScript MF module declarations for all federated remotes\n\n## What''s in this PR\n\n- Full app implementation (US-1 through US-9)\n- Bug fixes from Codex review (auth bootstrap state, Jest setup, TS\ndeclarations, stale configs)\n- Performance improvements (PriceCell/ValueCell leaf split,\nstartTransition on chart, useFlashAnimation in SDK)\n- Docs: rewritten README with screenshots, GIF, architecture diagram,\nand `docs/MODULE_FEDERATION_DEMO_GUIDE.md`\n\n## Still to do (post-merge)\n\n- Fill in `_TBD_` bundle size and CI time tables in\n`MODULE_FEDERATION_DEMO_GUIDE.md` with real measured numbers\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Boris Yankov <borisyankov@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Daniel Williams <me@dannyhw.com>\nCo-authored-by: Szymon Chmal <szymon@chmal.it>\nCo-authored-by: Daniel Williams <dannyhyunsoowilliams@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dccaeb0721fccb9b3cc9c72d97247b2836eaa59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/git/trees/4dccaeb0721fccb9b3cc9c72d97247b2836eaa59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstack/super-app-showcase/git/commits/97e39e4524e0d19f23f1b029f313ab36726f9ea8","verification":{"payload":"tree 4dccaeb0721fccb9b3cc9c72d97247b2836eaa59\nparent 0405f6248c99d741f81b386e1aee859b172fb422\nauthor Bartek Dybowski <b.dybowski@gmail.com> 1783405443 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783405443 +0200\n\nFintech Super App refresh — React Native micro-frontends showcase (#170)\n\n## Summary\n\nA full rebuild of the Super App Showcase into a production-grade Fintech\ndemo app demonstrating React Native micro-frontend architecture with\nRe.Pack and Module Federation V2.\n\n- **Trading mini app** — live crypto asset list (Kraken WebSocket), Skia\nchart with OHLC history, trade bottom sheet and success screen,\nReanimated flash animations\n- **Wallet mini app** — real-time portfolio balance, per-asset holdings\nwith live value updates\n- **Auth mini app** — dark Fintech sign-in screen, AuthProvider gating\nthe tab bar\n- **SDK** — singleton KrakenWebSocketService shared across all mini\napps, PriceProvider, hooks, utilities\n- **Host shell** — dark theme, native bottom tabs, MF remote wiring,\nReact Compiler\n\n## Key patterns demonstrated\n\n- Leaf-component isolation (`PriceCell`, `ValueCell`) so only the price\nnode re-renders on ticks\n- `useTransition` / `startTransition` marking price updates as\nnon-priority\n- Shared singleton WebSocket — one connection across Trading and Wallet\nvia MF\n- Historical chart seeding from Kraken OHLC REST API\n- TypeScript MF module declarations for all federated remotes\n\n## What''s in this PR\n\n- Full app implementation (US-1 through US-9)\n- Bug fixes from Codex review (auth bootstrap state, Jest setup, TS\ndeclarations, stale configs)\n- Performance improvements (PriceCell/ValueCell leaf split,\nstartTransition on chart, useFlashAnimation in SDK)\n- Docs: rewritten README with screenshots, GIF, architecture diagram,\nand `docs/MODULE_FEDERATION_DEMO_GUIDE.md`\n\n## Still to do (post-merge)\n\n- Fill in `_TBD_` bundle size and CI time tables in\n`MODULE_FEDERATION_DEMO_GUIDE.md` with real measured numbers\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Boris Yankov <borisyankov@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Daniel Williams <me@dannyhw.com>\nCo-authored-by: Szymon Chmal <szymon@chmal.it>\nCo-authored-by: Daniel Williams <dannyhyunsoowilliams@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTJuDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGRMQAFkp9zhzjYfwC2fjl4/3u9DG\n8eb6eL3VS