ubscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cell-Ed/workflows/commits/9f64f48e740023e83ce9b361d43971a21a79d139/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:55:23Z","email":"jeff@cell-ed.com","name":"Jeff Bruner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:55:23Z","email":"jeff@cell-ed.com","name":"Jeff Bruner"},"message":"Let a staging build target a template branch\n\nEvery service checks the OpenFaaS templates out at a hardcoded `ref: main`, in\nstaging and production alike, and templates.openfaas has no staging branch. A\ntemplate change therefore cannot be tried anywhere before it lands on main --\nand from that moment the next build of any service, production included, picks\nit up. Production 3.6.0 already shipped once from an unmerged branch, so this is\nnot hypothetical.\n\nAdds an optional `template_ref` input defaulting to ''main'', so existing callers\nbehave exactly as before and a service can point its staging build at a template\nbranch to verify it first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7342b809794e366f284226596a735836bbb5a50a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cell-Ed/workflows/git/trees/7342b809794e366f284226596a735836bbb5a50a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cell-Ed/workflows/git/commits/9f64f48e740023e83ce9b361d43971a21a79d139","verification":{"payload":"tree 7342b809794e366f284226596a735836bbb5a50a\nparent a2c068e0e85ebc857b3871cbab948b7a8af90144\nauthor Jeff Bruner <jeff@cell-ed.com> 1789073723 -0700\ncommitter Jeff Bruner <jeff@cell-ed.com> 1789073723 -0700\n\nLet a staging build target a template branch\n\nEvery service checks the OpenFaaS templates out at a hardcoded `ref: main`, in\nstaging and production alike, and templates.openfaas has no staging branch. A\ntemplate change therefore cannot be tried anywhere before it lands on main --\nand from that moment the next build of any service, production included, picks\nit up. Production 3.6.0 already shipped once from an unmerged branch, so this is\nnot hypothetical.\n\nAdds an optional `template_ref` input defaulting to ''main'', so existing callers\nbehave exactly as before and a service can point its staging build at a template\nbranch to verify it first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAggXVLgaYXZt+iNgL/1j5S1euD0I\nrBxiOslYG+3NdOwA8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPrziqAhtoqRJIyvj29KnUwWb/5FGnpsnVuHZmE0dzbtcVFpgdPSJN2PXQRg6sAUYo\nV7X6vw793WVnujY8y7fw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T20:55:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20307090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jsbruner","id":20307090,"login":"jsbruner","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzA3MDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsbruner","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cell-Ed/workflows/commit/9f64f48e740023e83ce9b361d43971a21a79d139","node_id":"C_kwDOIVrsVdoAKDlmNjRmNDhlNzQwMDIzZTgzY2U5YjM2MWQ0Mzk3MWEyMWE3OWQxMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://gith