ich the blog listing metadata with OG image and Twitter card; guard\nmetadataBase against an empty siteUrl and add global icons.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add My Works portfolio page\n\nAdd a /works route rendering a responsive grid of project cards (image,\ntitle, description, external link), backed by a typed getWorks() service\nand an editable project list. Includes CollectionPage + BreadcrumbList\nstructured data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add interactive Hire Me page\n\nAdd a /hire route with a pitch, skills, and an interactive contact form:\nselectable service cards, validated fields, and a pre-filled mailto\nsubmission. Service data is shared with ProfilePage + BreadcrumbList\nstructured data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add Works and Hire Me to site navigation\n\nReplace the Claudeck header link with Works and Hire Me pills, and add\nboth pages to the footer navigation. Also add rel=noopener noreferrer to\nthe footer external links.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(seo): home metadata, manifest icons, link a11y, 404 markup\n\nWire dedicated metadata into the home page; point the PWA manifest at\nexisting icon assets; add rel + aria-label to the social icon links; and\nfix invalid nested <p> markup on the 404 page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(seo): sitemap priorities, env docs, ignore generated files\n\nAdd /works and /hire priorities to next-sitemap; document the production\nNEXT_PUBLIC_WEBSITE_URL in the env example; and stop tracking the\nbuild-generated robots.txt and sitemap files (regenerated on each build\nfrom the deploy domain).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(works): real screenshots and accurate details for projects\n\nUpdate Claudeck entry with live screenshot, correct description, and\nhttps://claudeck.app URL. Replace placeholder with hamedfarag.dev entry\npointing at the site itself.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"822734f3154f7b161855a23d796bfe7c2a5ac570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hamed-farag/hamed-farag/git/trees/822734f3154f7b161855a23d796bfe7c2a5ac570"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hamed-farag/hamed-farag/git/commits/7e7679fe308eb3fd47f9a607a76375b5bdeb0637","verification":{"payload":"tree 822734f3154f7b161855a23d796bfe7c2a5ac570\nparent 09bcc5dcf4300ee6a9329d003eb9cbc9995bff75\nparent 1237c86304cb3e495d8433e3509da5961942db5c\nauthor Hamed Farag <hamed.farag.2009@gmail.com> 1781380778 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781380778 +0300\n\nfeat: add Works + Hire Me pages and site-wide SEO improvements (#15)\n\n* feat(seo): add page metadata and JSON-LD helpers\n\nAdd generateHomePageMetadata, generateWorksPageMetadata,\ngenerateHirePageMetadata, generateWorksJSONLD and generateHireJSONLD;\nenrich the blog listing metadata with OG image and Twitter card; guard\nmetadataBase against an empty siteUrl and add global icons.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add My Works portfolio page\n\nAdd a /works route rendering a responsive grid of project cards (image,\ntitle, description, external link), backed by a typed getWorks() service\nand an editable project list. Includes CollectionPage + BreadcrumbList\nstructured data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add interactive Hire Me page\n\nAdd a /hire route with a pitch, skills, and an interactive contact form:\nselectable service cards, validated fields, and a pre-filled mailto\nsubmission. Service data is shared with ProfilePage + BreadcrumbList\nstructured data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add Works and Hire Me to site navigation\n\nReplace the Claudeck header link with Works and Hire Me pills, and add\nboth pages to the footer navigation. Also add rel=noopener noreferrer to\nthe footer external links.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(seo): home metadata, manifest icons, link a11y, 404 markup\n\nWire dedicated metadata into the home page; point the PWA manifest at\nexisting icon assets; add rel + aria-label to the social icon links; and\nfix invalid nested <p> markup on the 404 page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(seo): sitemap priorities, env docs, ignore generated files\n\nAdd /works and /hire priorities to next-sitemap; document the production\nNEXT_PUBLIC_WEBSITE_URL in the env example; and stop tracking the\nbuild-generated robots.txt and sitemap files (regenerated on each build\nfrom the deploy domain).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(works): real screenshots and accurate details for projects\n\nUpdate Claudeck entry with live screenshot, correct description, and\nhttps://claudeck.app URL. Replace placeholder with hamedfarag.dev entry\npointing at the site itself.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLbaqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASaEQAGpH98fRFC21K+bsEteGPtKG\n1+I/XohXgmj4vrewgm7OU42phC0VhETX7MMA747epQDbyqGk1x4w1dv35rwqDzoi\ncdiiDF8V1PeotNZk5hShxbnME30RjKTr8TOhnk9n+Gi+9VuxeDjDDDwBmM8dD1Fm\n06q9ni3TcQP+WxffFE0AeKy7eZ3VL+Rpz8udveFjg3hZt74oSHQH7jGenx9AWZWv\nXjHHsQBsecbuY7kv19J5uIXkBo0Un0eaeLMk5HzOINO3k3PHFHuJlrM/QyxEUF4Y\nN2gN1ggyiNq/6JlbAn8y30u8xAxO0hL7ZzhVfk3S92Hd96Gst4Z6xXL05V0HMNCD\nVj9obxcai4QBpsvTtgxCMUjlTu9v+KllY2bVRHZ9Tmh51abhSYUCpSC1yvfjk/Au\nqmr